sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Brand
    participant BFE as Frontend (Brand)
    participant BE as Backend
    participant DB as MongoDB
    participant Bus as EventBus
    participant Msg as MessagingService
    actor Creator
    participant CFE as Frontend (Creator)

    Brand->>BFE: open creator profile, click Send Request
    BFE->>BE: POST /api/v1/collaborations
    BE->>BE: authenticate + authorize role=brand
    BE->>BE: validate input (Zod)
    BE->>DB: insert CollaborationRequest (status=Pending)
    DB-->>BE: request record
    BE-->>BFE: 201 Created

    Note over Creator,CFE: Creator opens inbox

    Creator->>CFE: open Inbox
    CFE->>BE: GET /api/v1/collaborations/inbox?page=1
    BE->>DB: find by userId, paginate
    DB-->>BE: requests + total
    BE-->>CFE: { data, pagination }

    alt Creator accepts
        Creator->>CFE: click Accept
        CFE->>BE: PATCH /api/v1/collaborations/:id/accept
        BE->>BE: verify recipient = current user
        BE->>DB: set status=Accepted
        BE->>Bus: emit COLLAB_ACCEPTED
        Bus->>Msg: handler: ensureConversation([brand, creator], requestId)
        Msg->>DB: upsert Conversation
        BE-->>CFE: 200 OK (request, conversationId)
    else Creator declines
        Creator->>CFE: click Decline
        CFE->>BE: PATCH /api/v1/collaborations/:id/decline
        BE->>BE: verify recipient = current user
        BE->>DB: set status=Declined
        BE-->>CFE: 200 OK (request)
    end
